{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_02",
  "title": "腿部拆卸療法",
  "storyCode": "EP-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "99ea42c73a9ad5fa6ad95e7594d5e9c3628946b35bb6713d1bd5f0b3d13bdc65",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g1_saltdesert_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……船速儀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不就是以前水手們用來記錄航程的東西嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以前接觸過這些東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯，我的老師帶著我學過很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的老師膽子還真大啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要一直站在我背後講個不停嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小子，你以為我想嗎？是水手長吩咐我要和你寸步不離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得我們的距離有點太近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個聲音……好熟悉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "捕捉到鹽粒流動的聲音，伊西多警覺地環顧四周，看見在船員的身後，熟悉的凹痕出現在鹽層表面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快閃開，有鹽鱗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃鱗屎了！你這個小子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鹽鱗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1585_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啾嘰……啾嘰……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就為了這個把我撞開嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不會以為鹽層下面是巨鱗吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那種巨鱗出現時地面會有劇烈震動，這種小傢伙只會留下一些凹痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，牠們和寶寶是同一個物種，能造成什麼破壞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真不知道那個瘋婆娘找你來幹嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1586_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鹽鱗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1585_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啾嘰……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩個……是同一種生物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鹽鱗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1585_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啾嘰……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的鹽鱗不只一種嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，大大小小共有幾十種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到你們的船帆使用了皮革材質，那些皮……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是鹽鱗的皮，我們的帳篷也用這個搭建。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你們帳篷外面曬的肉乾……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是鹽鱗做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "武器……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鹽鱗的骨頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那牠們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1586_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鹽鱗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1585_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啾嘰……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不一樣，除非迫不得已，不然我們不會傷害牠們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瘋婆娘很喜歡牠們，曾經想過捕捉到船上來飼養，但這種鹽鱗一旦離群就會迅速失去活力，所以她最終還是放棄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那牠為什麼會來到船上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1586_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哧哼哧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寶寶是被族群拋棄的孩子，因為身體過於孱弱，無法跟上其他鹽鱗的行進，幸好……瘋婆娘撿到了牠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鹽鱗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1585_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啾……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1586_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哧哼哧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "牠們要離開了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正常，牠們不會長時間停留在一個地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一條條鹽鱗又鑽入鹽層下，迅速游向遠處。\n鹽層上，數條凹痕交織相錯，仿若鏡面碎裂的紋路。\n伊西多覺得有趣，攀上一塊巉岩，試圖從高處遠眺裂紋延伸的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一站穩，竟看到另一條巨大的裂紋以極快的速度朝這裡衝刺而來，所到之處，鹽礁與骸骨盡數被吞噬。\n直到此時，伊西多才明白，那些鹽鱗並非離開，而是逃跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1586_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（焦急地轉圈）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……這絕對不正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到什麼了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快點躲開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "轉瞬間，分裂的地面如同巨口，要將狂奔的兩人吞食入腹。\n心急之下，塞斯克一腳踩空，腳踝被拖入塌陷的地縫中，發出了慘烈的嚎叫。\n伊西多緊緊抓住他的手臂，卻發現自己根本無法與自然的巨力抗衡。\n就在兩人即將被吞噬之際，塌陷奇蹟般地停了下來，裂縫將船員的小腿緊緊夾住，只見一片血肉模糊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "發生什麼事了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的船員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鹽層表面開裂，好像有人掉進去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個小子給我滾回來！休想跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……別丟下我一個人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1586_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哧……哼哧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的同伴就快來了，你會得救的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1586_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咬住伊西多的褲腳）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道，終歸是你們找不到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不、不行……你不能走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "水手長……有、有命令，我……得盯著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶寶",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1586_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吭——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibcave"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久沒來看你了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "計劃很順利……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我們是要冒一些風險，但那都是值得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們終將揚起風帆，回到海洋的懷抱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會為我高興嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "洞窟中，金屬刮擦石頭的聲音漸響，一隻身形細長的海嗣以扭曲的姿勢緩緩爬出。\n牠身上的觸肢各執一把武器，刺耳的聲音便是鋒刃劃在石壁上發出的。\n牠緩緩靠近鹽鱗肉，慢慢吞吃，眼睛卻一直注視著胡安娜。\n胡安娜對上牠的目光，靜靜等待著海嗣回答自己的問題。\n但她心裡清楚，這只是一隻全無理智與人性可言的野獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會離開的，不論付出什麼代價，我們都會離開鹽漠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "胡安娜轉身離開洞穴，只留下結束進食後猶如困獸般四處碰撞的海嗣。\n落石不斷滾下，最終，海嗣不再尋找出路，漸漸安靜下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g1_saltdesert_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天啊……怎麼回事？是不是那個小子做的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞斯克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不是，是我自己……但、但他跑了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
