      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您見過上面的這個傢伙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，我還收留過他一晚呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g11_meetingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾天後船隊要進入鹽漠捕獵鹽鱗，我希望那個小子能夠加入捕獵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個月來我們損失慘重，原本的船醫與領航員都犧牲在審判庭的圍剿中，我想讓那個小子接替他們的職務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來這就是你解決人力不足的辦法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蒂奇向我保證過，我才允許他加入發掘船幫助你們，但他今天卻差點跑掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在你們又和我說，要他加入捕鱗船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士……我知道這個小子是珍貴的煉金術師，但他的劍術也很出色，還會點醫術，在捕鱗的過程中，他會派上大用場的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這無異於放他離開，他肯定會找機會逃脫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是個海盜，魯斯，沒有那樣的好心腸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，求您，經歷幾次圍剿後我們已經損失了太多人手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在船隊裡，不是只有您需要他……我們也需要他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魯斯，他不是什麼老實的孩子，非常調皮，你要怎麼保證他能乖乖的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他與帕斯卡拉素昧平生，卻願意在她被審判庭追殺時出手相救，將她安全送往小鎮後，也從未索取任何報酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他本可以放棄營救塞斯克獨自離開，但他沒有。他選擇折返回來，幫助我們救下他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他……他其實是個熱心的好孩子，非常善良。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們只要向他展示出，我們有多需要他，他就不會坐視不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那支隊伍還有消息傳來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至今沒有……事關我們接下來一個月的食物儲備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓他去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g17_lighthouse_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你那個朋友我記得是個年輕小夥子吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長得也還不錯，可惜……年紀輕輕的就……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠了……不要再說了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要去找他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "極境？極境！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "溫蒂，棘刺現在一定在那裡等著我們去救他……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給你，通訊器。你留在小鎮裡，我要前往鹽漠找他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦……但……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小鎮裡發生什麼事的話就用這個通知我！我們保持聯絡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意安全——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "極境！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "棘刺，等我！我來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年輕人，怎麼就不聽人把話講完呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，您本來是想說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是感慨一下，那個孩子年紀輕輕的回到伊比利亞學什麼劍術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到別的國家過日子不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫蒂",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_400_weedy_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g9_community_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麵包……被燒焦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該也能吃吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這群讓人頭痛的小鬼……我遲早有一天要把他們的腦袋揍到開花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好沒有造成太嚴重的損失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咀嚼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個小子怎麼抱著一塊炭在啃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我餓了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把手裡的東西丟掉，跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1590_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加入捕鱗船之前，你要學的東西還很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "捕鱗船，什麼捕鱗船？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
